# T15-E-M22 [边界清单 #23] bind 签名种类强制：非可调用宿主成员（os.sep 为 str）声明为
#   方法 → 绑定期拒绝（不静默包装）
# doc: docs/howto/extend_with_host_binding.md + docs/architecture/01_native_host_binding.md
# expect-class: GUARD
# expect-out: Runtime Error: [ERROR][RUN_GENERIC_ERROR]: Host binding: member 'os.sep' is not callable but declared as method.
# expect-exit: nonzero
# expect-llm: false
import python "os" as oslib:
    bind sep() -> str
print("DONE")
